# THERMO-SRP has no environment variables.
#
# This file is provided only because a .env.example is commonly expected
# in a project's root. The application is a fully client-side static
# prototype: no API keys, no backend URL, no build-time secrets, and no
# external services are required to run it.
#
# If you ever add environment variables to this project with Vite, they
# must be prefixed with VITE_ to be exposed to client code, e.g.:
# VITE_EXAMPLE_FLAG=true
